WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.720 line:90%,end
The voice from the deepest part of the castle kept calling AyShe.

2
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.830 line:90%,end
Using Nyra's map, the team climbed down through a secret passage.

3
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.840 line:90%,end
According to the map, this is the place.

4
00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:14.800 line:90%,end
But there's no door, just a huge crystal wall.

5
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.290 line:90%,end
AyShe placed her palm on the wall.

6
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.820 line:90%,end
The number twenty-three glowed, and the wall melted open like water.

7
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:27.160 line:90%,end
Inside, a woman made of light appeared in the middle of a giant crystal heart.

8
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:31.380 line:90%,end
You've finally come, Twenty-Three. I am Doctor Ekin Var.

9
00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.930 line:90%,end
I have been waiting for you for three hundred years.

10
00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:38.620 line:90%,end
Waiting for me? Who are you? How do you know my name?

11
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:44.100 line:90%,end
In twenty ninety-nine, Earth was dying. I designed the twenty-three capsules.

12
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.260 line:90%,end
I placed a piece of humanity in each one.

13
00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:50.200 line:90%,end
You are the last one. You are the key.

14
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.180 line:90%,end
Your heart will awaken Elyra.

15
00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.240 line:90%,end
And what about the Shadow? Where did it come from?

16
00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:59.190 line:90%,end
For a moment, Doctor Ekin's light flickered.

17
00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:04.630 line:90%,end
The Shadow is my greatest mistake. I made it to look like you.

18
00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:07.230 line:90%,end
But I forgot to give it a heart.

19
00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:12.330 line:90%,end
Everyone looked at AyShe in silence. But Eray's mind was somewhere else.

20
00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.440 line:90%,end
Excuse me, Doctor.

21
00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:18.300 line:90%,end
If you've been alone here for three hundred years, have you ever eaten pizza?

22
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:23.080 line:90%,end
Doctor Ekin smiled for the first time. The crystal heart glowed even brighter.

23
00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:26.220 line:90%,end
Say the code Leon remembered.

24
00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:29.530 line:90%,end
Capsules five, six and eight are ready.

25
00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.880 line:90%,end
Five. Six. Eight.

26
00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:36.930 line:90%,end
In the hall beneath the castle, three capsules opened at once.

27
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.340 line:90%,end
The number of sleepers dropped to eleven.

28
00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:43.720 line:90%,end
I detect three new heartbeats. All healthy. Welcome.

29
00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.790 line:90%,end
But the joy didn't last long.

30
00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:49.620 line:90%,end
A red crack appeared on the crystal heart.

31
00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.580 line:90%,end
You forgot me, Mother. But I never forgot you.

32
00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.040 line:90%,end
The Shadow had entered the core. And this time, it wasn't alone.

